          <h3 data-i18n="mcp_f1">Secure connection</h3>
          <p data-i18n="mcp_f1_text">Enterprise-grade TLS 1.3 encryption with token-based authentication. Your data stays inside your own infrastructure.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="svc-card is-static" data-reveal="1">
          <div class="svc-card-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 3 4 14h6l-1 7 9-11h-6l1-7z"/></svg></div>
