          <p data-i18n="mcp_f2_text">Instant synchronisation between AI and Odoo with an average latency under 12 ms — no waiting for batch jobs.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="svc-card is-static" data-reveal="1">
          <div class="svc-card-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="7" width="16" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M9 12h.01"/><path d="M15 12h.01"/><path d="M12 4v3"/></svg></div>
