          <p data-i18n="mcp_f3_text">Let AI automate routine work — create invoices, search records and trigger business logic on request.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="svc-card is-static" data-reveal="1">
          <div class="svc-card-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 20h18"/><path d="M6 20v-6"/><path d="M11 20V8"/><path d="M16 20v-9"/><path d="M21 20V5"/></svg></div>
