          <h3 data-i18n="mcp_f5">Easy integration</h3>
          <p data-i18n="mcp_f5_text">Connect in under five minutes. Paste the SSE endpoint into your AI client — no server setup required.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="svc-card is-static" data-reveal="1">
