    <!-- ============================================================
         5. THREE WAYS TO CONNECT
         ============================================================ -->
    <section id="connect" class="mh-sec"><div class="container">
      <div class="mh-head" data-reveal="1">
        <h2 data-i18n="mcp_methods_title">How to connect AI to Odoo</h2>
        <p data-i18n="mcp_methods_text">Three ways to plug AI into your Odoo: Claude directly via MCP, any API provider through the platform, or free local AI with Ollama — all bridged to your live Odoo data.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-cards">
        <article class="svc-card is-static" data-reveal="1">
          <div class="svc-card-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 7H7a5 5 0 0 0 0 10h2"/><path d="M15 7h2a5 5 0 0 1 0 10h-2"/><path d="M8 12h8"/></svg></div>
          <h3 data-i18n="mcp_m1">MCP SSE · Direct</h3>
          <p data-i18n="mcp_m1_text">Connect Claude.ai or Claude Desktop straight to Odoo with a single URL. No API key and no code — Claude gets live Odoo tools instantly.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="svc-card is-static" data-reveal="1">
          <div class="svc-card-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="14" rx="2.5"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M8 22h8"/><path d="M12 18v4"/></svg></div>
          <h3 data-i18n="mcp_m2">REST API · Web platform</h3>
          <p data-i18n="mcp_m2_text">Log in to the MCP Odoo web platform with your own API key. Supported providers include Anthropic, OpenAI, DeepSeek and Groq. Chat with your Odoo directly in the browser.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="svc-card is-static" data-reveal="1">
          <div class="svc-card-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="12" rx="2.5"/><path d="M8 21h8"/><path d="M12 17v4"/></svg></div>
          <h3 data-i18n="mcp_m3">Local · Free · Private</h3>
          <p data-i18n="mcp_m3_text">Run open-source AI on your own hardware. Zero API cost and complete data privacy — ideal for on-premise Odoo where nothing leaves your network.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <!-- ============================================================
         6. HOW IT WORKS
         ============================================================ -->
    <section id="how-it-works" class="mh-sec mh-sec-alt"><div class="container">
      <div class="mh-head" data-reveal="1">
        <h2 data-i18n="mcp_how_title">How it works</h2>
        <p data-i18n="mcp_how_text">Four simple steps to connect AI to your Odoo instance.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-grid">
        <article class="process-step" data-reveal="1"><h3 data-i18n="mcp_h1">Create account</h3><p data-i18n="mcp_h1_text">Sign up and access your MCP Odoo dashboard with connection tools and usage analytics.</p></article>
        <article class="process-step" data-reveal="1"><h3 data-i18n="mcp_h2">Configure Odoo</h3><p data-i18n="mcp_h2_text">Install the MCP module in your Odoo instance and follow the guided setup wizard.</p></article>
        <article class="process-step" data-reveal="1"><h3 data-i18n="mcp_h3">Generate endpoint</h3><p data-i18n="mcp_h3_text">Get your unique SSE endpoint URL — the secure token that bridges AI to your Odoo data.</p></article>
        <article class="process-step" data-reveal="1"><h3 data-i18n="mcp_h4">Connect Claude</h3><p data-i18n="mcp_h4_text">Add the endpoint to your AI client settings and start using AI-powered Odoo features immediately.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div></section>

