        <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button"><span data-i18n="mcp_faq_q1">What is the Model Context Protocol?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a" data-i18n="mcp_faq_a1">The Model Context Protocol is an open standard that lets AI assistants use external tools. Here it connects your AI client securely to your Odoo data.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button"><span data-i18n="mcp_faq_q2">Do I need an API key for Claude?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a" data-i18n="mcp_faq_a2">No. The direct MCP connection uses an SSE endpoint added as a connector in Claude — no API key is required. API keys are only needed for API-based providers.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-q" type="button"><span data-i18n="mcp_faq_q3">Which Odoo versions are supported?</span><span class="faq-icon">+</span></button><div class="faq-a" data-i18n="mcp_faq_a3">Odoo Community and Enterprise, versions 16, 17 and 19, including environments hosted on MyOdoo.sh.</div></div>
